# Troubleshooting

## Issue

Sysmon events were not being forwarded.

The Splunk logs reported:

```
Could not subscribe to the event log channel
ErrorCode=5 (Access Denied)
```

---

## Root Cause

The Splunk Universal Forwarder service did not have sufficient permissions to subscribe to the Sysmon event channel.

---

## Resolution

The Splunk Universal Forwarder service was configured to run using the **Local System** account.

After restarting the service, Sysmon telemetry was successfully forwarded to Splunk Enterprise.

